    "text": {
     "en": "Tables of 6, 7, 8 and 9 can be built from tables you know.\n6 × 7 = 42, and 7 × 6 = 42. The order does not matter.\nFor 9: 9 × n is 10 × n minus n. For example, 9 × 7 = 70 - 7 = 63.\nFor 8: double the table of 4.\nFill the mystery matrix with products like 32, 42, 45, 54, 56, 63."
    }
